Package: cpu-night-mode
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd (>= 249)
Description: scheduled CPU frequency ceilings for quiet nights
 Applies a configurable maximum CPU frequency during a daily time window
 and restores the original policy limits afterward. Includes a systemd
 service, a configuration file, and a command-line status utility.
